  "fairness_statement": "PRAHARI predicts crime risk for geographic areas and time windows, not for individuals. It uses historical FIR data which reflects reported crime, not true crime rates. Areas with lower reporting or clearance rates may appear safer than they are. We compute reporting-bias indicators (chargesheet-based clearance rates) and flag at-risk districts for analyst review. Risk scores are explained via SHAP to ensure transparency. No demographic attributes (religion, caste) are used as model features.",
